-<section id="provider"><h2>1. Provider and acceptance</h2><p>This website and the Intent Radar SaaS platform are provided and operated by Planebyte Studios ("PlaneByte", "we", "us"), headquartered in Bangalore, India. By accessing or using our website, requesting a demonstration, or opening an account at <a href="https://app.planebyte.com/">app.planebyte.com</a>, you agree to these Terms of Service. Questions may be directed to <a href="mailto:contact@planebyte.com">contact@planebyte.com</a>.</p></section>
-<section id="scope"><h2>2. Marketing website scope</h2><p>Our marketing website provides product information, interactive interface demonstrations, and inquiry forms. Interactive previews showcase the research workflow and illustrative data; they do not perform live market searches or execute binding commercial actions without an authenticated workspace.</p></section>
-<section id="products"><h2>3. Product availability &amp; entitlements</h2><p>Intent Radar delivers buyer-intent intelligence and Growth Intelligence. Workspace access, monthly search limits, background monitors, AI operation quotas, and team seats are defined by your selected subscription plan. All capabilities are delivered digitally as cloud-based software-as-a-service.</p></section>
-<section id="subscription"><h2>4. Prices, billing &amp; subscriptions</h2><p>Our published monthly plans (Starter at $59, Growth at $149, Scale at $379, and Enterprise custom plans) are billed monthly in USD unless an annual agreement is explicitly confirmed. Subscriptions renew automatically each billing cycle until cancelled. You may cancel at any time through account settings or by contacting <a href="mailto:contact@planebyte.com">contact@planebyte.com</a>. Cancellations take effect at the end of the current paid billing period.</p><p>We offer a 7-day money-back guarantee on initial subscription purchases, subject to our Cancellation and Refund Policy. Credit card, debit card, UPI, and banking payments are processed through secure, authorized payment gateway partners (including PayU). PlaneByte never stores payment card credentials directly on our marketing website.</p></section>
-<section id="sources"><h2>5. Responsible use of public data</h2><p>Intent Radar monitors publicly available discussions and communities (including Hacker News, Reddit, GitHub, job boards, and tech forums). Public availability does not grant permission for spam or unlawful outreach. Users agree to comply with all applicable privacy laws, source terms of service, and outreach regulations when contacting prospective leads. AI-generated interpretations should be verified against original discussion links before taking commercial action.</p></section>
-<section id="ai-content"><h2>6. AI-generated content &amp; prohibited NSFW outputs</h2><p>PlaneByte's Intent Radar platform includes AI-powered synthesis, summaries, interpretations, and analytical features.</p><p>Users are strictly prohibited from using these features to request, generate, create, or distribute Not Safe for Work (NSFW), pornographic, sexually explicit, or otherwise unlawful sexual content.</p><p>This restriction applies to user prompts, AI-generated interpretations, synthesized reports, summaries, and all other AI-generated outputs.</p><p>Any content involving the sexual exploitation or abuse of minors is strictly prohibited.</p><p>PlaneByte reserves the right to restrict access, remove prohibited content where technically possible, suspend accounts, or terminate services for violations of this policy.</p></section>
-<section id="content"><h2>7. Intellectual property &amp; website materials</h2><p>All trademarks, logos, interface designs, text, graphics, and software code on planebyte.com are the intellectual property of Planebyte Studios. Users may not copy, reverse engineer, or exploit website assets without prior written consent.</p></section>
-<section id="limitations"><h2>8. Accuracy, warranties &amp; liability</h2><p>PlaneByte provides its services on an "as is" and "as available" basis. While we strive to deliver reliable market intelligence and high platform uptime, we do not warrant that market searches will yield specific revenue, conversion rates, or customer contracts. In no event shall PlaneByte be liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from reliance on research findings.</p></section>
-<section id="contact"><h2>9. Governing law &amp; updates</h2><p>These terms are governed by the laws of India, with jurisdiction in the courts of Bangalore. We may periodically update these terms to reflect evolving service capabilities; revisions will be posted on this page with an updated effective date. Effective date: November 2026.</p></section>
