-<section id="timeline"><h2>4. Refund processing timeline &amp; payment method</h2><p>All refund requests are reviewed and acknowledged by our billing team within 24 to 48 business hours of receipt at <a href="mailto:contact@planebyte.com">contact@planebyte.com</a>.</p><p>Once approved, refunds are initiated immediately and credited back to the original payment source (credit card, debit card, UPI, or net banking via our payment gateway partner PayU) within 5 to 7 business days, depending on your banking institution's processing schedule.</p></section>
-<section id="contact"><h2>5. Contact for billing inquiries</h2><p>For any questions regarding billing, subscription upgrades, cancellation, or refund status, contact our billing team directly at <a href="mailto:contact@planebyte.com">contact@planebyte.com</a>. We respond to billing requests within one business day.</p></section>
